#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:1
#: fc5326f16c4d455b9249c454fa2db2c3
msgid "代表性采样（最远点采样）"
msgstr "Representative sampling (Farthest Point Sampling)"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:3
#: 542cb4f3a9214439811c394fe7a1e94e
msgid "界面按钮：`代表性采样`（`Sparse samples`）。"
msgstr "Interface button: `Representative Sampling` (`Sparse samples`)."

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:5
#: f9a52e99ea59432d96cf3cc586631086
msgid "这个工具解决什么问题"
msgstr "What problem does this tool solve?"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:7
#: bf316ab2146747e6911dd28db13e3b5c
msgid ""
"候选池里经常有大量相似结构。最远点采样（Farthest Point Sampling，FPS）把每个结构表示成一个 "
"描述符向量，并优先选择离已有样本最远的结构，从而用较少样本覆盖较大的描述符空间。"
msgstr ""
"Candidate pools often contain many similar structures. Farthest Point "
"Sampling (FPS) represents each structure as a descriptor vector and "
"repeatedly chooses the structure farthest from the samples already "
"selected, covering a larger descriptor space with fewer structures."

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:10
#: a02512a34982474aa223c8d6d8d0b250
msgid "它解决的是**冗余**，不是**数据质量**。短键、错误标签和不合理结构应先清洗，再做 FPS。"
msgstr ""
"It addresses **redundancy**, not **data quality**. Clean short bonds, "
"incorrect labels, and unreasonable structures before running FPS."

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:12
#: d3c2f75ea140462cbf84a9dabcb908da
msgid "最远点采样原理"
msgstr "How Farthest Point Sampling works"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:14
#: 014edea97f244aa78c692b4790b868e2
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"设第 $i$ 个候选结构的描述符为 $\\mathbf{x}_i$，当前已经选出的描述符集合为 $S$。 每一轮计算候选点到集合 $S$ "
"的最近距离："
msgstr ""
"Let $\\mathbf{x}_i$ be the descriptor of candidate structure $i$, and let"
" $S$ be the set of descriptors selected so far. At each step, compute the"
" nearest distance from each candidate to $S$:"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:17
#: cbab8d7d55d44d4e9be670aa4412a9c0
msgid ""
"\n"
"d(i,S)=\\min_{\\mathbf{x}_j\\in "
"S}\\left\\|\\mathbf{x}_i-\\mathbf{x}_j\\right\\|_2\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"d(i,S)=\\min_{\\mathbf{x}_j\\in "
"S}\\left\\|\\mathbf{x}_i-\\mathbf{x}_j\\right\\|_2\n"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:21
#: b4a15ea5d22b4b548e719f6a639e978e
msgid "然后选择最近距离最大的候选："
msgstr "Then choose the candidate with the largest nearest distance:"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:23
#: 89d6478d96b84ec18ef00cd13ec63a41
msgid ""
"\n"
"i^\\*=\\arg\\max_{i\\notin S}d(i,S),\\qquad\n"
"S\\leftarrow S\\cup\\{\\mathbf{x}_{i^\\*}\\}\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"i^\\*=\\arg\\max_{i\\notin S}d(i,S),\\qquad\n"
"S\\leftarrow S\\cup\\{\\mathbf{x}_{i^\\*}\\}\n"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:28
#: 9ca4dcc8aea846ccbd397dc66b7a94fb
#, python-brace-format
msgid "$\\mathbf{x}_i$ 是结构级 NEP 描述符或其 PCA 坐标，没有 Å、eV 之类的物理单位。"
msgstr ""
"$\\mathbf{x}_i$ is a structure-level NEP descriptor or its PCA "
"coordinates; it does not have physical units such as Å or eV."

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:29
#: dd38f38f9ced45a9a2ed7da4e39018fe
msgid "$\\|\\cdot\\|_2$ 是欧氏距离。"
msgstr "$\\|\\cdot\\|_2$ is the Euclidean distance."

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:30
#: 025766ef17d34eaf811b91c220b110cc
msgid ""
"`最小距离`（`Min distance`）记为 $\\delta$。当所有剩余候选都满足 $d(i,S)<\\delta$ "
"时，采样会提前停止，所以实际数量可以小于“样本上限”。"
msgstr ""
"Let `Min distance` be $\\delta$. Sampling stops early when every "
"remaining candidate satisfies $d(i,S)<\\delta$, so the actual count can "
"be smaller than the sample limit."

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:32
#: 9362262b782c4aa08e45c84023b03e44
msgid "提供“训练数据集”后，训练集描述符会作为初始集合 $S_0$。此时优先选择训练集尚未覆盖的候选， 而不是重新挑一批与训练集重复的结构。"
msgstr ""
"When a training dataset is provided, its descriptors form the initial set"
" $S_0$. The sampler then prioritizes candidates not covered by the "
"training set instead of selecting another batch that duplicates it."

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:36
#: ed73f6f6f40d44988014039e35667201
msgid ""
"`最小距离`的数值依赖当前 NEP 模型以及“原始描述符/降维后描述符”的选择，不能跨模型直接复用。 更换 `nep.txt` "
"或描述符来源后，应重新观察距离尺度。"
msgstr ""
"The value of `Min distance` depends on the current NEP model and on "
"whether raw or reduced descriptors are used; it cannot be reused blindly "
"across models. Recheck the distance scale after changing `nep.txt` or the"
" descriptor source."

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:40
#: b674541b0bc84004b2461ce4b1d56ad1
msgid "两种选择策略"
msgstr "Two selection strategies"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:35
#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:87
#: 608a586a208142c8b1c272a2e37f67f8 dd59b98983b94982ba9131f22585cdee
msgid "中文界面选项"
msgstr "Chinese UI option"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:35
#: fcf0aa964cf7422fb3cea21aad36884f
msgid "算法"
msgstr "Algorithm"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:35
#: ca1afb1b0b1147ba93ad3ae49df6590c
msgid "适用场景"
msgstr "Use case"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:35
#: d165301231984f73b9ec56b90f4167bf
msgid "主要限制"
msgstr "Main limitation"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:35
#: 1f0e314289884316ad2fefe36af8aba1
msgid "`全局 FPS（兼容模式）`"
msgstr "See the parameter description for details."

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:35
#: 7f68e68d0b714a019d9cdbe6fc0dee34
msgid "所有候选共享一个 FPS 集合和总预算"
msgstr "All candidates share one FPS set and one total budget"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:35
#: 0cee7627433a41a8b285ea47259e02a6
msgid "数据属于同一化学体系，或希望完全复现旧流程"
msgstr ""
"The data belong to one chemical system, or you need to reproduce the "
"legacy workflow exactly"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:35
#: a15f6d93e4b84226b036c541768064bd
msgid "大数据组可能占满预算，小元素集合可能一个都选不到"
msgstr ""
"A large group can consume the budget, leaving a small element set with no"
" samples"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:35
#: 44da128a73d64e70abe7d58e6fcff661
msgid "`元素集合平衡 FPS`"
msgstr "See the parameter description for details."

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:35
#: ef946b1381854caa898f4e7687128d8c
msgid "先按结构所含元素集合分组，再在每组内独立 FPS"
msgstr ""
"Group structures by their element set, then run FPS independently within "
"each group"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:35
#: 6ee3fea77276409ebc88bee9e99f7b4b
msgid "一个候选池混有 Fe、Fe-O、Fe-Ni-O 等不同体系"
msgstr "One candidate pool mixes systems such as Fe, Fe-O, and Fe-Ni-O"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:35
#: 4542434248f745e1a6be255e18952827
msgid "强制使用原始描述符和固定数量模式；样本上限不得小于元素集合组数"
msgstr ""
"Requires raw descriptors and fixed-count mode; the sample limit must be "
"at least the number of element-set groups"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:47
#: 770df72b1c294b90b9eb42a2af6044ff
msgid "平衡策略先给每个非空元素集合一个名额。剩余预算按组大小的平方根分配。若第 $g$ 组有 $n_g$ 个候选，其额外名额近似满足："
msgstr ""
"The balanced strategy first gives one slot to each non-empty element set."
" It distributes the remaining budget by the square root of the group "
"size. If group $g$ has $n_g$ candidates, its additional allocation "
"approximately satisfies:"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:50
#: ffaa0ec17fb247e8b4a85abb87115f6e
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"q_g-1\\propto\\sqrt{n_g}\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"q_g-1\\propto\\sqrt{n_g}\n"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:54
#: 9831783d789e4e6e94d2422e58adbf45
msgid ""
"程序还会把名额限制在该组实际结构数以内，并按小数余量补齐整数预算。没有训练集时，每组从最靠近 "
"该组描述符中心的结构开始；有训练集时，只使用**元素集合完全相同**的训练结构作为该组初始集合。"
msgstr ""
"The program also caps each allocation at the number of structures in that"
" group and rounds the integer budget using the fractional remainders. "
"Without a training set, each group starts from the structure closest to "
"its descriptor center; with a training set, only training structures with"
" exactly the same element set seed that group."

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:57
#: b247e88b298844bcb6b8125c85eeb7b7
msgid "平方根配额比按结构数线性分配更照顾小组，但它不表示各体系同等重要。训练目标本身有明确权重时， 仍应先拆分候选池或分别设定预算。"
msgstr ""
"A square-root allocation gives small groups more consideration than a "
"linear allocation by group size, but it does not mean that all systems "
"are equally important. If the training objective has explicit weights, "
"split the candidate pool or set separate budgets first."

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:60
#: 174ec00c06e74eefa020c8e26c8aeef1
msgid "两种采样模式"
msgstr "Two sampling modes"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:62
#: cb532c880cab4c72a4dd7d961cf8a60d
msgid "固定数量（FPS）"
msgstr "Fixed count (FPS)"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:64
#: 8a389f77f3744abf8312014c2a442d3f
msgid "最多选择“样本上限”个结构。以下任一条件满足时提前结束："
msgstr ""
"Select at most “Sample limit” structures. Stop early when any of the "
"following is true:"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:66
#: 3e051d8f0b5d46eb92548f4bd0abdc5e
msgid "已达到样本上限；"
msgstr "The sample limit has been reached;"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:67
#: 2f58c209dffc4fd78962cb2fbd077701
msgid "候选已用完；"
msgstr "No candidates remain;"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:68
#: fac223904fbf4806834645d690407f17
msgid "最大最近距离小于“最小距离”。"
msgstr "The largest nearest distance is below “Min distance”."

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:70
#: 8e34c32fee4d4a17bfe74f5cebce1dfa
msgid "因此“样本上限”是上限，不是保证数量。"
msgstr "Therefore, “Sample limit” is a cap, not a guaranteed count."

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:72
#: dfe40b05e9654e31969292e0351ad851
msgid "$R^2$ 停止（FPS）"
msgstr "$R^2$ stopping (FPS)"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:74
#: 48734852eaea4c0ea64fac2325eb9e37
msgid "只在“全局 FPS”中可选。程序每轮仍按 FPS 选点，但会计算当前实现定义的描述符方差覆盖分数："
msgstr ""
"This option is available only for “Global FPS”. The program still selects"
" points by FPS, but also computes the descriptor-variance coverage score "
"defined by the current implementation:"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:76
#: 8614b3f0cc514dd986838c128071dabd
msgid ""
"\n"
"R^2_{\\mathrm{cover}}\n"
"=\n"
"\\frac{\\sum_{i\\in "
"S}\\left\\|\\mathbf{x}_i-\\bar{\\mathbf{x}}\\right\\|_2^2}\n"
"{\\sum_{i=1}^{N}\\left\\|\\mathbf{x}_i-\\bar{\\mathbf{x}}\\right\\|_2^2},"
"\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"\\bar{\\mathbf{x}}=\\frac{1}{N}\\sum_{i=1}^{N}\\mathbf{x}_i\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"R^2_{\\mathrm{cover}}\n"
"=\n"
"\\frac{\\sum_{i\\in "
"S}\\left\\|\\mathbf{x}_i-\\bar{\\mathbf{x}}\\right\\|_2^2}\n"
"{\\sum_{i=1}^{N}\\left\\|\\mathbf{x}_i-\\bar{\\mathbf{x}}\\right\\|_2^2},"
"\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"\\bar{\\mathbf{x}}=\\frac{1}{N}\\sum_{i=1}^{N}\\mathbf{x}_i\n"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:85
#: 7f34e42856844260bee55522ffd94d67
msgid "当 $R^2_{\\mathrm{cover}}$ 达到“$R^2$ 阈值”时停止；“样本上限”和“最小距离”仍然同时生效。"
msgstr ""
"Stop when $R^2_{\\mathrm{cover}}$ reaches the “$R^2$ threshold”; “Sample "
"limit” and “Min distance” remain active at the same time."

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:88
#: 61c7759966f24e4ab185c5ab25496e8d
msgid ""
"这里的 $R^2_{\\mathrm{cover}}$ 是 NepTrainKit 的**描述符方差覆盖停止指标**，不是回归模型的决定系数， "
"也不是重构误差。它偏重远离描述符均值的点，不能单独证明训练误差已经收敛。"
msgstr ""
"Here $R^2_{\\mathrm{cover}}$ is NepTrainKit's **descriptor-variance "
"coverage stopping metric**. It is not the coefficient of determination of"
" a regression model and not a reconstruction error. It emphasizes points "
"far from the descriptor mean, so it cannot by itself show that training "
"error has converged."

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:92
#: 4ec75003fcb4436f840ad83edb81ac18
msgid "描述符来源"
msgstr "Descriptor source"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:87
#: 990bf15a955241f0ba17304a1d736802
msgid "实际距离空间"
msgstr "Actual distance space"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:87
#: 6ea814b70caa4b939ea1917f717826ba
msgid "效果"
msgstr "Effect"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:87
#: aa50c0751bbe47b7961cab6c70ee1786
msgid "`降维后（PCA）`"
msgstr "See the parameter description for details."

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:87
#: 941a714397754c15ba1185858a3a58b6
msgid "当前数据的 PCA 坐标；合并训练集时会在候选与训练描述符上联合降到二维"
msgstr ""
"PCA coordinates of the current data; when a training set is included, "
"candidates and training descriptors are reduced jointly to two dimensions"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:87
#: 7739b2d930be42e597e025688d2ca79f
msgid "速度快、便于和叠加图对应，但降维可能丢失低方差方向"
msgstr ""
"Fast and easy to compare with the overlay plot, but dimensionality "
"reduction can lose low-variance directions"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:87
#: 8bfdbd55b0434ee782a63294216eb140
msgid "`原始描述符`"
msgstr "See the parameter description for details."

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:87
#: 81b06989d6044407bd4ccc9497ecf5dd
msgid "缓存的结构级原始描述符"
msgstr "Cached structure-level raw descriptors"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:87
#: 6dd465fb75e647a89c4d72a4050e03ec
msgid "保留完整描述符信息，但距离尺度随维度和模型变化"
msgstr ""
"Preserves the full descriptor information, but the distance scale changes"
" with dimensionality and the model"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:99
#: 48f8fdca8ebd4bd6b50f19bbbc245861
msgid "如果请求原始描述符但当前没有缓存，程序会提示并回退到降维空间。元素集合平衡 FPS 不允许这种回退； 缺少原始描述符时会停止并报错。"
msgstr ""
"If raw descriptors are requested but no cache is available, the program "
"reports this and falls back to the reduced space. Element-set-balanced "
"FPS does not allow this fallback; it stops with an error when raw "
"descriptors are missing."

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:102
#: c4295d97cba542db8d243386bf705127
msgid "“将当前选择作为区域”到底做什么"
msgstr "What does “Use current selection as region” actually do?"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:104
#: f7f45def5e75427999d6830172e71e26
msgid "这个选项不是“把当前选择当作已经保留的训练集”，而是把当前选中的结构限制为**本次 FPS 的候选区域**："
msgstr ""
"This option does not treat the current selection as an already-retained "
"training set. Instead, it restricts the current selection to the "
"**candidate region for this FPS run**:"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:106
#: 7d9a136443354e6eb61a7b6686670caf
msgid "先在主图上选中想清理的局部点群。"
msgstr ""
"First select the local cluster of points you want to clean on the main "
"plot."

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:107
#: ecb0e402267b4667a51e248e92ea6e63
msgid "勾选“将当前选择作为区域”并运行 FPS。"
msgstr "Check “Use current selection as region” and run FPS."

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:108
#: 7c9a67005fc14915b0f35264b7e42ec4
msgid "FPS 只在这批已选结构中找代表点。"
msgstr ""
"FPS searches for representative points only within the selected "
"structures."

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:109
#: e97ef36a05a0452f9bafcbf46c0361df
msgid "运行结束后，程序会把代表点从当前选择中**取消选择**。"
msgstr ""
"When the run ends, the program **deselects** the representative points "
"from the current selection."

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:110
#: 03132050a77e4db7a6a88dbd3784a261
msgid "仍保持选中的，是该区域内未被 FPS 保留的冗余结构，可直接点击“删除选中结构”。"
msgstr ""
"The structures that remain selected are redundant structures in that "
"region that FPS did not retain; you can click “Delete selected "
"structures” directly."

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:112
#: c105ea482ce64ea9bc5414511f55500a
msgid ""
"也就是说，它实现的是“在选定区域内保留代表点、留下冗余点供删除”。如果当前没有选择，或者当前子图 "
"上找不到这些选择，程序会提示并退回到全数据采样；此时结果会按普通方式加入选择集。"
msgstr ""
"In other words, it keeps representative points within the selected region"
" and leaves redundant points selected for deletion. If nothing is "
"selected, or the current subplot cannot find those selections, the "
"program reports the issue and falls back to sampling all data; the result"
" is then added to the selection set normally."

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:115
#: 08651fc2294644e791ea13c14bac9bfe
msgid "其他参数"
msgstr "Details for this option"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:87
#: 586e415dc1514100b2711a0f409a9c9d
msgid "中文界面字段"
msgstr "Details for this option"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:87
#: 6a7058464ad747499a5ebe074c00f151
msgid "怎么选"
msgstr "Details for this option"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:87
#: 3ff316c878cb4020919bb278bac0a9e4
msgid "改变什么"
